{"municipality_code":"11225","pref":"埼玉県","city":"入間市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"入間市には、扇町屋村、黒須村、高倉村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、産業施設、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「坂東山遺跡」、「東金子窯跡群」、「出雲祝神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、扇町屋村や黒須村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 田・新田・用水にちなむ地名が多い場所では、土地改良碑や用水記念碑も注目したい探索対象です。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 「彩の森入間公園」や「桜山展望台」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":35,"rank":974,"percentile":48.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":46,"rank":410,"percentile":78.3,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":37,"rank":680,"percentile":63.0,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":15,"rank":491,"percentile":71.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":5,"rank":776,"percentile":53.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":2,"rank":1236,"percentile":23.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":20,"rank":811,"percentile":55.9,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people"